 <h3><a name="xfile">XV. X Syntax</a></h3>
 <p>Black = 1 byte. <span class="blue">Blue = 4 bytes = data.</span> <span class="red">Red = string = data[+byte(s)].</span> <span class="green">Green = replacement.</span></p>
